      "text": [
        " : قُلْتُ لَهُ جُعِلْتُ فِدَاكَ نَرَى اَلدَّوَابَّ فِي بُطُونِ أَيْدِيهَا مِثْلُ اَلرُّقْعَتَيْنِ فِي بَاطِنِ يَدَيْهَا مِثْلُ اَلْكَيِّ فَأَيُّ شَيْءٍ هُوَ قَالَ «ذَلِكَ مَوْضِعُ مَنْخِرَيْهِ فِي بَطْنِ أُمِّهِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2476 - Hammad ibn Uthman narrated from Abu Abdullah (as), who said:\nI said to him, \"May I be your ransom! We see markings on the undersides of the forelegs of animals, like two patches or brands. What is that?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"That is the place where their nostrils were positioned while they were in their mother's womb.\""
        ]
      }
